ormalSouth",["3"]],["EndMovement",[]],["WalkNormalSouth",["2"]],["WalkNormalWest",["2"]],["WalkNormalSouth",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0557_T22FS0101_00000"]],["End",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0557_T22FS0101_00001"]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0557_T22FS0101_00000":"When you first catch a Pokémon,\\nit may be weak.\\rBut it will eventually grow to\\nbe strong.\\rIt’s important to treat Pokémon\\nwith love.","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00001":"Pokémon can hold items like a Potion\\nor an Antidote.\\rBut they don’t appear to know how\\nto use man-made items.","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00002":"Long time no see, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\nI’ve been waiting for you.\\fThis is from Professor Elm.\\rThe thing is...we would like you to\\ntake care of an Egg! {YESNO 0}","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00003":"Long time no see, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\nI’ve been waiting for you.\\fThis is from Professor Elm.\\rThe thing is...we would like you to\\ntake care of an Egg! {YESNO 0}","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00004":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\nthe Egg from the assistant!","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00005":"After you left, Professor Elm received\\na phone call. I have no idea what they\\fwere talking about.\\rBut, after a while, Professor Elm\\nsuddenly cried out, “I can’t think of\\fanyone more suited than {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!”\\rThen he insisted that I hand this Egg\\nto you.\\rThat’s how I came here to deliver the\\nEgg to you.\\rIt seems that a Pokémon will hatch from\\nit only when you keep it in your party\\fof Pokémon.\\rThat’s another reason we’ve\\nchosen you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\rPlease take care of it!\\r","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00006":"After you left, Professor Elm received\\na phone call. I have no idea what they\\fwere talking about, but after a while,\\fProfessor Elm suddenly cried out,\\f“I can’t think of anyone more suited\\ffor that than {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!”\\rThen he insisted that I hand this Egg\\nto you.\\rThat’s how I came here to deliver the\\nEgg to you.\\rIt seems that a Pokémon will hatch from\\nit only when you keep it in your party\\fof Pokémon.\\rThat’s another reason we’ve\\nchosen you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\rPlease take care of it!\\r","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00007":"Your party is full.\\nYou cannot take the Egg yet.\\fI’ll wait here for you.","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00008":"What?\\nI never expected you’d say no!\\fYou must be kidding, right?\\rProfessor Elm really wants you to\\ntake care of it...\\n\\n","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00009":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\\nwill you take this Egg? {YESNO 0}","msg_0557_T22FS0101_00010":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\\nwill you take this Egg? {YESNO 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"std_hide_show_deliverymen"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T22FS0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T22FS0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T22FS0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T22FS0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T22FS0101_004":4,"obj_T22FS0101_gsoldwoman1":0,"obj_T22FS0101_gsman3":1,"obj_T22FS0101_shopm1_2":2,"obj_T22FS0101_shopm1_2_2":3,"obj_T22FS0101_assistantm":4,"obj_T22FS0101_delivery2":5,"obj_T22FS0101_delivery":6}}
